{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>The blessing of YHWH</b> — that He gives to the righteous; it grants him wealth." "<b>and it adds no</b> — HaShem adds no sorrow to the righteous; sorrow along with the blessing. And the opposite of this: \"in sorrow you shall eat\"; and the blessing is to add good, and the curse is lack."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:59.960048137Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}